{'symbol': 'APA', 'date': '2019-12-23 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Apache Says Co And Total Announced Joint Venture Agreement To Explore, Develop Block 58 Offshore Suriname', 'text': 'CO AND TOTAL S.A. ANNOUNCED A JOINT VENTURE AGREEMENT TO EXPLORE AND DEVELOP BLOCK 58 OFFSHORE SURINAME.UNDER THE TERMS OF AGREEMENT, CO AND TOTAL WILL EACH HOLD A 50 PERCENT WORKING INTEREST IN BLOCK 58.CO WILL OPERATE FIRST 3 EXPLORATION WELLS IN BLOCK, INCLUDING THE MAKA CENTRAL-1 WELL, AND SUBSEQUENTLY TRANSFER OPERATORSHIP TO TOTAL.TRANSACTION HAS RECEIVED ALL NECESSARY APPROVALS FROM SURINAME AND IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE WITHIN THREE DAYS.IN EXCHANGE FOR A 50-PERCENT WORKING INTEREST, APACHE WILL RECEIVE VARIOUS FORMS OF CONSIDERATION.'}{'symbol': 'BIO', 'date': '2019-12-23 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': "The International Trade Commission Issues Final Decision Affirming 10X Genomics Infringement Of Three Of Bio-Rad's Patents", 'text': "THE INTERNATIONAL TRADE COMMISSION ISSUES FINAL DECISION AFFIRMING 10X GENOMICS INFRINGEMENT OF THREE OF BIO-RAD’S PATENTS.BIO RAD LABORATORIES INC -  ITC ALSO ISSUED A LIMITED EXCLUSION ORDER AND CEASE AND DESIST ORDER AGAINST 10X GENOMICS.BIO RAD LABORATORIES-ITC DECISION DOESN'T AFFECT CO'S ONGOING LAWSUITS IN DELAWARE AND MASSACHUSETTS THAT ACCUSE 10X INFRINGING OTHER BIO-RAD PATENTS."}{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2019-12-23 15:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'BlackRock Discloses Below 5% Stake In NMC Health As Of Dec. 20 Vs Prior Stake Of 5.11%', 'text': ':BLACKROCK DISCLOSES BELOW 5% STAKE IN NMC HEALTH AS OF DEC. 20 VERSUS PRIOR STAKE OF 5.11%'}{'symbol': 'DISH', 'date': '2019-12-23 14:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Sling TV Says Monthly Price Of Base Services For Sling Orange And Sling Blue Subscribers Raised To $30 Each', 'text': 'SLING TV SAYS MONTHLY PRICE OF BASE SERVICES FOR SLING ORANGE AND SLING BLUE SUBSCRIBERS RAISED TO $30 EACH.SLING TV SAYS MONTHLY SUBSCRIPTION TO BOTH SLING ORANGE AND SLING BLUE RAISED TO $45.'}{'symbol': 'ECL', 'date': '2019-12-23 11:30:0